ELe-vJngNgymB92PAEtM-_ZbeQqdogqQCBlw&oe=6A36B631"}, {"file_name": "screen-3.png", "id": "3813784448888886", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75308617_3813784452222219_8861854153164055038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b7UacB-SyFwQ7kNvwFqOmvF&_nc_oc=Adp5QL0pze2tP8GGxom6G4rUcmLhJitNYapwBrJPT6JEcG9NnKnEQ5l89TWjLJEZ7ak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8LYANbla8U-Ss8gL-rk-dWPhUf_cIjqhMbFG7hay5GWg&oe=6A36B61A"}, {"file_name": "screen-4.png", "id": "510210628338938", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031359_510210631672271_3889054620789481961_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gXR8Z7hNDwIQ7kNvwFp4Xl-&_nc_oc=AdpXJLljyNxI9O-lq_nSoRj1NhnnQXCSyo3qlbUVSzWG0gDpfv8rGOUCO8EwDep7k-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-TpwZCVMq47jl_Te8YQcteW2uPv_Abr-4yDyDozNqPPQ&oe=6A36BC93"}, {"file_name": "screen-5.png", "id": "1241621836834075", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031652_1241621840167408_8711678203036836320_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yxzrb6ALxWIQ7kNvwH8z_EY&_nc_oc=AdoB55r49HZX0_9GU1B2NvF2QpNqdmp-h7cNEwdN2dIsMVFpg3DZTTeNZytrJB8VQmQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_0E1zvwtKmNI21SMgptAtOUNUFAtgLOyoD_7oDcG6o0Q&oe=6A36995F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Mod3_Title.png", "id": "3693715237561510", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036644_3693715240894843_8945723129178385145_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pAjPrOUA15sQ7kNvwH_8COi&_nc_oc=AdpeB-ZI3VwhRVwnwWGKYBHZJOO9lTpmKFzD00Uauz1qcOcgERCNsLv2LUqdRYEV-fk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8mQPjmh14fjbE1dxiCB3EYv8EglEwuAbKypeSLrDvVLA&oe=6A36B0FE"}, "display_name": "Hololab VR - NCSG Inspection Foundation Module 3: Masonry Wood External", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Hololab NCSG Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR Application**\n\nThe Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing. Users are challenged to perform inspections with randomized issues in a virtual residential setting, ensuring all necessary procedures are followed.\n\n**VR Controls and PPE \u2013** Learn how to navigate the virtual environment while getting acquainted with essential personal protective equipment.\n\n**Responsibility & Worksite Hazard Assessment \u2013** Operate in a simulated environment to identify and mitigate hazards commonly encountered during inspections of wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Familiarization \u2013** Understand different types of wood-burning freestanding stoves and their common features.\n\n**Freestanding Stove Inspection \u2013** Utilize the official NCSG checklist to thoroughly inspect wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Real-World Simulation \u2013** Complete the inspection by correctly identifying issues with maximum safety awareness and forensic skills.\n\nData reports for review are saved and stored for engagement metrics and simulation performance analysis.\n\nAny off-platform monetization of content accessible in this app conforms to the Oculus Bulk IAP or Subscription Licenses app policy outlined here: https://developer.oculus.com/policy/app-policies", "short_description": "The Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ftfvr.com